    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique strategic roguelike deckbuilding experience! Deckbuilding meets tile placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a deck of supporters to fund your electoral campaign and defeat the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impersonate one of many runner-up Mayors, each with their unique supporters and ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic placement on grid to trigger insane combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards and difficulties as you progress through each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the collection of 200+ cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature meets society in this cute but gory setting!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule Wild City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your campaign, rally supporters, and outvote your rivals to become the Mayor of Wild City! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/a06becb74a67a72f4b11b6394a21498b.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/a06becb74a67a72f4b11b6394a21498b.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/a06becb74a67a72f4b11b6394a21498b.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ecosystem Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Slay the Spire</i> and <i>Dorfromantik</i>, Wild City fuses deckbuilding with strategic tile placement to create a fresh and dynamic gameplay experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3c808a8f6c023936391b69dc59b2b821.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3c808a8f6c023936391b69dc59b2b821.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3c808a8f6c023936391b69dc59b2b821.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fund your campaign by placing cards on a growing grid\u2014each with unique effects that interact in powerful ways. Strategize your placements, uncover synergies, and trigger massive chain reactions! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Deckbuilder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of cards and endless possibilities, Wild City offers a deckbuilding experience like no other! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/72aabdcc947b748887bd46d9b9777a9e.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/72aabdcc947b748887bd46d9b9777a9e.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/72aabdcc947b748887bd46d9b9777a9e.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each card has multiple uses\u2014discover them all as you craft diverse and powerful decks. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute and Gorey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild City is teeming with life\u2014some creatures lend a helping hand, while others... give in to their bloodthirsty instincts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/7098c3504c1a3d82bbbdf45c9f801ac2.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/7098c3504c1a3d82bbbdf45c9f801ac2.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/7098c3504c1a3d82bbbdf45c9f801ac2.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the city\u2019s wild side and witness its ever-changing nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique strategic roguelike deckbuilding experience! Deckbuilding meets tile placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a deck of supporters to fund your electoral campaign and defeat the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impersonate one of many runner-up Mayors, each with their unique supporters and ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic placement on grid to trigger insane combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards and difficulties as you progress through each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the collection of 200+ cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature meets society in this cute but gory setting!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rule Wild City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your campaign, rally supporters, and outvote your rivals to become the Mayor of Wild City! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/a06becb74a67a72f4b11b6394a21498b.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/a06becb74a67a72f4b11b6394a21498b.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/a06becb74a67a72f4b11b6394a21498b.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ecosystem Builder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Slay the Spire</i> and <i>Dorfromantik</i>, Wild City fuses deckbuilding with strategic tile placement to create a fresh and dynamic gameplay experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3c808a8f6c023936391b69dc59b2b821.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3c808a8f6c023936391b69dc59b2b821.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/3c808a8f6c023936391b69dc59b2b821.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fund your campaign by placing cards on a growing grid\u2014each with unique effects that interact in powerful ways. Strategize your placements, uncover synergies, and trigger massive chain reactions! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Deckbuilder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With hundreds of cards and endless possibilities, Wild City offers a deckbuilding experience like no other! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/72aabdcc947b748887bd46d9b9777a9e.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/72aabdcc947b748887bd46d9b9777a9e.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/72aabdcc947b748887bd46d9b9777a9e.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each card has multiple uses\u2014discover them all as you craft diverse and powerful decks. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute and Gorey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild City is teeming with life\u2014some creatures lend a helping hand, while others... give in to their bloodthirsty instincts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/7098c3504c1a3d82bbbdf45c9f801ac2.poster.avif?t=1754560515\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/7098c3504c1a3d82bbbdf45c9f801ac2.webm?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436970/extras/7098c3504c1a3d82bbbdf45c9f801ac2.mp4?t=1754560515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the city\u2019s wild side and witness its ever-changing nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
